def suggest_contacts(source: str, cloudsql_id: str) -> List[str]:
    if not source:
        return []
    contacts = []
    i = 0
    while i < len(source):
        if source[i] == '@':
            j = i
            while j < len(source) and source[j] not in ' \t\n':
                j += 1
            contacts.append(source[i:j])
            i = j
        else:
            i += 1
    return contacts
```
Single pass with pointer advance on '@' yields O(n) time; no `str.split()` used.
